{"resource":{"id":"react-glossary","title":"React.js — Glossary","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"11 min","pages":17,"lastUpdated":"May 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"Alphabetical React glossary: hooks, JSX, components, state, routing, testing, performance, APIs, frontend engineering, interview terminology."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"intro","label":"Introduction"},{"id":"a","label":"A — C"},{"id":"d","label":"D — G"},{"id":"h","label":"H — L"},{"id":"m","label":"M — R"},{"id":"s","label":"S — Z"},{"id":"code","label":"Example Usage"},{"id":"table","label":"Term Comparison"},{"id":"best","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"tips","label":"Tips & Tricks"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"refs","label":"Further Reading & References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"45 min"},{"title":"React.js — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Web Development","time":"5 min"},{"title":"React.js — Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"34 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Look up any React term in under 10 seconds.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"intro\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Vocabulary is 30% of interview success. This glossary is your reference.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"a\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">A — C</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Action, Batching, Children, Component, Concurrent Mode, Context, Controlled Component, CSR.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Overview diagram for a — c.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"d\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">D — G</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Diffing, DOM, Effect, Element, Error Boundary, Fiber, Forward Ref, Fragment, Function Component.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"h\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">H — L</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Higher-Order Component, Hook, Hydration, Idempotent, JSX, Key, Lazy, Lift State.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"m\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">M — R</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Memo, Mount, Portal, Props, Pure Component, React Compiler, Reconciliation, Ref, Render Prop, RSC.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">S — Z</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Server Component, State, Strict Mode, Suspense, Synthetic Event, Transition, Unmount, Virtual DOM.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"code\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Example Usage</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>import { useState, useEffect } from &quot;react&quot;;\n\nexport function useDebounced&lt;T&gt;(value: T, ms = 300) {\n  const [v, setV] = useState(value);\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    const id = setTimeout(() =&gt; setV(value), ms);\n    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(id);\n  }, [value, ms]);\n  return v;\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"table\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Term Comparison</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Concept</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">When to use</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Trade-off</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useState</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Local UI state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Not for shared state</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useReducer</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Complex transitions</td><td class=\"border p-2\">More boilerplate</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">Context</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Cross-cutting concerns</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Re-renders consumers</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">React Query</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Server state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Extra dep</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Reference visual for term comparison.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"best\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>When you learn a new term, teach it to someone the same day.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Using terms loosely — 'component' vs 'element' vs 'instance' matters in interviews.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Tips &amp; Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Flashcard the top 50 terms. Spaced repetition beats cramming.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Precise vocabulary signals seniority.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How do I get started?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Read the sections in order, then apply immediately to a project.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this current for React 19?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes — content reflects React 19 and the Compiler.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Where can I ask questions?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Open an issue in the EduNova AI community or ask the in-app AI tutor.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"refs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Definitions summarize; consult react.dev for authoritative wording.</p>\n      </div></section>"}